  "title": "Bran Muffins II",
  "description": "This batter of bran cereal, flour and buttermilk will make four-dozen muffins and keeps in the refrigerator up to six weeks, so you can always have hot bran muffins in just the few minutes it takes to bake them.",
  "authors": [
    "Pal Joey"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-03-17T16:21:22-05:00",
